replyText:
{
  "riskLevel": "medium",
  "scope": { "airportId": "GAO", "scenarioPeriod": "第6天晚上20:00" },
  "rationale": [
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Scenario EVT005 at 第6天晚上20:00 records low temperature with relatively high wind at GAO. Only the weather report REPORT:EVT005-0 is usable as a current input, and it is a competition-simulation assertion with no report timestamp.",
        "zh": "事件 EVT005（第6天晚上20:00）记录高原机场低温且风速较大。当前可用输入只有天气报告 REPORT:EVT005-0，且该报告为赛事模拟断言，未提供报告时间。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["EVT005", "REPORT:EVT005-0"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The second supplied report, REPORT:EVT005-1, is the earlier assistant escalation proposal, not an independent weather or operational observation. It cannot be counted as a second current source.",
        "zh": "另一份报告 REPORT:EVT005-1 是此前智能助手的升级建议，不是独立的天气或运行观测，不能计为第二个当前来源。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-1", "EVT005"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "No official airport operating status and no status source are supplied for this period. That matches a weather-risk situation without a formal status: prepare monitoring checks and communication drafts, and do not state that flights will be delayed.",
        "zh": "该时段没有提供官方机场运行状态，也没有状态来源编号。这对应“有天气风险但无正式运行状态”的情形：准备监测清单与沟通草案，不得声称航班一定延误。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE002", "REPORT:EVT005-0"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The event record itself lists the field resource details and the basis of the operator's judgement as unknown. The operator's view that current resources suffice is therefore human input to be recorded, not verified evidence.",
        "zh": "事件记录本身把现场资源明细和运营人员判断依据列为未知信息。因此“当前资源足以应对”是应被记录的人工意见，而不是已核实的证据。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["EVT005", "RULE001", "RULE006"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The historical baseline covers 24 monthly rows from 2024-01 through 2025-12. The only month at or beyond five percentage points below its own prior-12-month mean is 2025-02, at -6.1 pp (completed-as-planned 72.88%). One such anomaly calls for a focused historical review, not a current high rating or a weather attribution.",
        "zh": "历史基线包含 2024-01 至 2025-12 共 24 个月度记录。唯一达到或超过低于自身前12个月平均5个百分点的月份是 2025-02，为 -6.1 个百分点（按计划完成航班比例 72.88%）。此类单点异常需要专项历史复核，而不是当前高风险判断或归因于天气。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-02"],
      "metricIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-02:delta", "OPS-GAO-2025-02:completion"]
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The most recent month in the file, 2025-12, shows completed-as-planned 79.44% against a prior-12-month mean of 78.54%, a difference of +0.9 pp. The monthly baseline therefore does not by itself support a high rating.",
        "zh": "数据中最新的月份为 2025-12，按计划完成航班比例 79.44%，前12个月平均 78.54%，差值为 +0.9 个百分点。因此月度基线本身并不支持高风险判断。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-12"],
      "metricIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-12:completion", "OPS-GAO-2025-12:historical", "OPS-GAO-2025-12:delta"]
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Cold-season monthly records for GAO include 2025-12 with mean temperature -1.4°C and maximum wind 18.2 m/s, and 2024-01 with mean 0.4°C and maximum wind 22.8 m/s. These aggregates show cold-and-windy conditions are within the recorded range, but monthly statistics cannot confirm conditions at the scenario hour.",
        "zh": "高原机场冷季月度记录包括 2025-12 平均气温 -1.4°C、最大风速 18.2 米/秒，以及 2024-01 平均气温 0.4°C、最大风速 22.8 米/秒。这些汇总数据说明低温大风在此机场记录范围内，但月度统计无法确认场景时段当时的实际状况。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["WX-GAO-2025-12", "WX-GAO-2024-01"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The airline's business importance at GAO is recorded as low in the 2025 scale row. That affects prioritisation and resourcing attention, not the risk rating or the checks that are still required.",
        "zh": "2025 年规模记录显示该航空公司在此机场的业务重要程度为低。这影响优先级和资源关注度，但不改变风险等级，也不减少仍需完成的核查。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["SCALE-GAO-2025"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The recorded human review rejected the wording of the earlier first step and asked instead for a single consolidated airport ground-support capability confirmation that states the source update time and which resource categories remain unconfirmed. That wording is adopted as the first action; the original verification points are kept as follow-up checks, because the review adds no new operational facts and its outcome is still pending.",
        "zh": "已记录的人工复核否决了此前第一步建议的表述，要求先索取一份统一的机场保障能力确认，其中说明来源更新时间和仍未确认的资源类别。本评估采纳该表述作为首要动作；原有核查要点保留为后续检查，因为复核未提供新的运行事实，且其结果仍为待定。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE006", "EVT005"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The rejection reason and the original recommendation stay on record; the proposal may be adjusted when new facts arrive, but the human opinion may not be overwritten or deleted. Outputs must be labelled as simulation and use aggregated information only — no passenger or staff personal data is used here.",
        "zh": "否决理由和原建议应保留在记录中；有新事实时可调整建议，但不得覆盖或删除人工意见。输出必须标注为模拟，并且只使用汇总信息——本次未使用旅客或员工个人信息。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE006", "RULE010", "RULE011"],
      "metricIds": []
    }
  ],
  "possibleImpacts": [
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "If cold plus strong wind is confirmed for the scenario hour, ground servicing and turnaround at a small airport could slow down; this is a hypothesis to check with the airport, not an observed event.",
        "zh": "如果场景时段的低温加大风得到确认，小型机场的地面保障和过站效率可能下降；这是需与机场核实的假设，不是已发生的事件。"
      },
      "kind": "assumption",
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-0", "RULE002"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Because no official operating status exists, passenger-facing wording must remain non-committal; no delay or cancellation can be announced from this evidence.",
        "zh": "由于没有官方运行状态，面向旅客的表述必须保持不确定；依据现有证据不得发布延误或取消信息。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE005", "REPORT:EVT005-0"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Low recorded business importance lowers commercial priority relative to larger stations, but it does not remove the verification and monitoring duties for this period.",
        "zh": "业务重要程度记录为低，意味着相对于更大机场商业优先级较低，但并不免除该时段的核查与监测职责。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["SCALE-GAO-2025", "RULE002"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Whether the operator's resource judgement covers the whole scenario window, or only the moment of the report, is unknown and would change how much weight it can carry.",
        "zh": "运营人员的资源判断是覆盖整个场景时段，还是仅覆盖报告时刻，目前未知，而这会影响该判断可被赋予的权重。"
      },
      "kind": "unknown",
      "evidenceIds": ["EVT005"],
      "metricIds": []
    }
  ],
  "assumptionsToVerify": [
    {
      "en": "That a single consolidated ground-support capability confirmation exists or can be issued by the airport for this period.",
      "zh": "机场就该时段已有或能够出具一份统一的保障能力确认。"
    },
    {
      "en": "That an official weather observation or forecast with a timestamp and named source exists for the scenario hour.",
      "zh": "场景时段存在带时间和明确来源的官方气象观测或预报。"
    },
    {
      "en": "That no official airport operating status has been issued; the absence of a supplied status source may reflect retrieval gaps rather than a real absence.",
      "zh": "确实没有发布官方机场运行状态；未提供状态来源可能是检索缺口，而非真实缺失。"
    },
    {
      "en": "That the operator's resource judgement was based on documented, current information rather than general experience.",
      "zh": "运营人员的资源判断基于有记录的当前信息，而非一般经验。"
    },
    {
      "en": "That the two supplied reports describe the same time window and that no further current reports exist outside this set.",
      "zh": "两份报告描述的是同一时间范围，且本集合之外没有其他当前报告。"
    }
  ],
  "informationGaps": [
    {
      "en": "Field resource details: staffing, equipment and ground-support capacity available for the period.",
      "zh": "现场资源明细：该时段可用的人员、设备与地面保障能力。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The evidence basis behind the operator's judgement that current resources are sufficient.",
      "zh": "运营人员判断“当前资源足以应对”的证据依据。"
    },
    {
      "en": "An official weather observation or forecast for the scenario hour, with its update time and issuing source.",
      "zh": "场景时段的官方气象观测或预报，及其更新时间和发布来源。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Any official airport or airline operating status, and the identity of the issuing authority.",
      "zh": "任何官方机场或航空公司运行状态，以及发布主体的身份。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Whether the reports are independent of each other; the supplied set contains only one usable weather report.",
      "zh": "各报告之间是否相互独立；所提供集合中只有一份可用天气报告。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Traffic concentration for the period (arrivals, departures, connections) and the applicable validity window of any confirmation received.",
      "zh": "该时段的航班集中程度（进港、出港、中转）以及所收到确认的适用有效期。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Whether any safety-related signal has been raised; none is supplied, and such a signal would change the handling.",
      "zh": "是否出现任何安全相关信号；本次未提供，若出现将改变处理方式。"
    }
  ],
  "firstAction": {
    "id": "first",
    "kind": "prepare_information",
    "text": {
      "en": "SIMULATION / DRAFT: prepare one consolidated information request to GAO airport coordination for a single ground-support capability confirmation for 第6天晚上20:00, explicitly asking for the confirmation's source update time, the resource categories that remain unconfirmed, whether an official operating status has been issued, and the scope and validity window of the confirmation. Do not send without human approval.",
      "zh": "模拟 / 草案：向高原机场协调方准备一份统一的信息索取，请其就第6天晚上20:00出具一份地面保障能力确认，明确说明该确认的来源更新时间、仍未确认的资源类别、是否已发布官方运行状态，以及该确认的范围和有效期。未经人工批准不得发送。"
    },
    "evidenceIds": ["EVT005", "REPORT:EVT005-0", "RULE002", "RULE006"],
    "ruleIds": ["RULE002", "RULE006", "RULE009"]
  },
  "subsequentActions": [
    {
      "id": "follow-1",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": {
        "en": "Separately verify whether an official weather observation or forecast with a timestamp and named source exists for the scenario hour, and whether any official airport operating status has been issued; keep these two questions distinct from the resource confirmation.",
        "zh": "另行核查场景时段是否存在带时间和明确来源的官方气象观测或预报，以及是否已发布官方机场运行状态；这两项问题应与资源确认分开处理。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-0", "RULE001", "RULE002"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE001", "RULE002", "RULE009"]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-2",
      "kind": "monitor",
      "text": {
        "en": "Run a monitoring list for the period: confirmed weather versus reported conditions, ground-support availability, and any change in official status. Escalate to the operations lead if a second independent current report appears or the confirmed conditions worsen. Do not convert monitoring into schedule decisions.",
        "zh": "对该时段执行监测清单：已确认天气与实际报告状况的差异、地面保障可用性，以及官方状态的变化。若出现第二个独立的当前报告或已确认状况恶化，则上报运营负责人。不得把监测转化为航班计划决定。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-0", "RULE002"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE002", "RULE009"]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-3",
      "kind": "prepare_draft",
      "text": {
        "en": "Keep the three audience drafts (operations, airport coordination, passengers) marked SIMULATION / 模拟 and DRAFT / 草案, and route them for human approval before any use. The passenger version must not state or imply delay or cancellation.",
        "zh": "三份按对象区分的草案（运行、机场协调、旅客）均应标注“模拟”和“草案”，并在任何使用前提交人工审批。旅客版本不得陈述或暗示延误或取消。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE005", "RULE010"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE005", "RULE010"]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-4",
      "kind": "refer",
      "text": {
        "en": "Refer to the operations lead: record the rejection reason, the operator's resource judgement and any new facts in the incident log, and let the lead decide whether the escalation proposal is kept, revised or withdrawn. The original recommendation and the human opinion must both remain on file.",
        "zh": "上报运营负责人：在事件记录中登记否决理由、运营人员的资源判断以及任何新事实，由负责人决定保留、修改或撤回升级建议。原建议与人工意见都必须保留在记录中。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["EVT005", "RULE006"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE006", "RULE009"]
    }
  ],
  "escalationConditions": [
    {
      "en": "An official airport or airline operating status is issued for the period, whatever its content.",
      "zh": "该时段发布任何官方机场或航空公司运行状态，不论内容如何。"
    },
    {
      "en": "A second, independent current report on weather or ground conditions at GAO appears.",
      "zh": "出现第二份关于高原机场天气或地面状况的独立当前报告。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The source or reliability of the current weather information becomes unassessable, or any safety-related issue is raised; action conclusions must then stop and the matter goes to the operations lead.",
      "zh": "当前天气信息的来源或可靠性变得无法判断，或出现任何安全相关问题；此时必须停止行动结论，并移交运营负责人。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The airport's consolidated confirmation shows a resource shortfall, or states that its validity does not cover the whole scenario window.",
      "zh": "机场的统一确认显示资源不足，或说明其有效期不覆盖整个场景时段。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Anyone requests a cancellation, release, dispatch, maintenance or compensation decision; those go to the responsible specialist and are not handled here.",
      "zh": "任何人要求就取消、放行、调度、维修或赔付作出决定；这些应交由相应专业负责人，不在此处理。"
    }
  ],
  "humanDecisions": [
    {
      "en": "Operations lead: whether to keep, revise or withdraw the escalation proposal after reading the consolidated capability confirmation and the recorded operator reasoning.",
      "zh": "运营负责人：在阅读统一保障能力确认与已记录的运营人员判断后，决定保留、修改还是撤回升级建议。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Operations lead: confirm the acceptance criteria for the resource confirmation (scope, validity window, source update time) before any escalation is reconsidered.",
      "zh": "运营负责人：在重新考虑升级前，确认资源确认的接受标准（范围、有效期、来源更新时间）。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Passenger service lead: approve or reject the passenger wording; it may not be published as supplied.",
      "zh": "旅客服务负责人：批准或否决旅客表述；不得按原文直接对外发布。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Any decision touching schedule, dispatch, release, maintenance or compensation is reserved to the named professional and is not covered by this assessment.",
      "zh": "任何涉及航班计划、调度、放行、维修或赔付的决定均由指定专业人员保留，不在本评估范围内。"
    }
  ],
  "drafts": {
    "operations": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / DRAFT — GAO, 第6天晚上20:00. Prioritised checks for human review, not instructions to act: 1) Obtain one consolidated airport ground-support capability confirmation, including its source update time and the resource categories still unconfirmed. 2) Confirm whether an official weather observation or forecast with timestamp and source exists for the hour. 3) Confirm whether any official airport operating status has been issued. 4) Log the operator's judgement that resources suffice, with its basis, and keep the earlier recommendation and rejection reason intact. 5) Re-check if a second independent current report appears; escalate to the operations lead if conditions are confirmed worse. The only usable current input is the reported low temperature with relatively high wind; no flight-level impact is established. Any schedule, dispatch, release or compensation decision goes to the responsible specialist.",
        "zh": "模拟 / 草案——高原机场，第6天晚上20:00。供人工复核的优先核查项，不是行动指令：1）取得一份统一的机场地面保障能力确认，包含其来源更新时间和仍未确认的资源类别。2）确认该时段是否存在带时间与来源的官方气象观测或预报。3）确认是否已发布官方机场运行状态。4）登记运营人员关于资源足以应对的判断及其依据，并完整保留原建议与否决理由。5）若出现第二个独立当前报告则重新核查；若确认状况恶化则上报运营负责人。当前唯一可用输入是“低温并有较大风速”的报告，尚未确立对航班的具体影响。任何航班计划、调度、放行或赔付决定均由相应专业负责人处理。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["EVT005", "REPORT:EVT005-0", "REPORT:EVT005-1", "RULE002", "RULE006"]
    },
    "airportCoordination": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / DRAFT — request to GAO airport coordination, for human approval before sending. Scope: the 第6天晚上20:00 operating period at GAO. Please provide one consolidated confirmation of ground-support capability covering: (a) the source update time of the confirmation; (b) which resource categories you consider still unconfirmed, in your own terms; (c) whether an official operating status has been issued and by whom; (d) the scope and validity window the confirmation covers. Please also state whether the reported low temperature with relatively high wind is affecting any ground activity you can confirm. We are not asking for, and will not issue, any statement that flights are delayed or cancelled.",
        "zh": "模拟 / 草案——致高原机场协调方的信息索取，发送前需人工批准。范围：高原机场第6天晚上20:00运行时段。请提供一份统一的地面保障能力确认，包含：（a）该确认的来源更新时间；（b）按贵方口径仍在确认中的资源类别；（c）是否已发布官方运行状态及发布主体；（d）该确认所覆盖的范围和有效期。也请说明所报告的低温较大风速是否正在影响贵方可确认的具体地面作业。我方不索取、也不会发布任何关于航班延误或取消的表述。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["EVT005", "REPORT:EVT005-0", "RULE002", "RULE009"]
    },
    "passenger": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / DRAFT — public wording, not for release without approval. Low temperatures and relatively strong winds have been reported for the 第6天晚上20:00 period at 高原机场 (GAO). We have not confirmed an official airport operating status from our sources, so we cannot tell you at this stage whether your flight will be affected. Please check the official airline and airport channels for the current status of your flight before travelling. We will not speculate about delays or cancellations here.",
        "zh": "模拟 / 草案——对外表述，未经批准不得发布。据报道，高原机场（GAO）第6天晚上20:00时段出现低温并伴有较大风速。我方尚未从现有来源确认官方机场运行状态，因此现阶段无法告知您的航班是否会受影响。出行前请通过航空公司与机场的官方渠道查询航班的当前状态。我们不会在此推测延误或取消。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-0", "RULE005"]
    }
  },
  "evidenceReferences": [
    "EVT005",
    "REPORT:EVT005-0",
    "REPORT:EVT005-1",
    "OPS-GAO-2025-02",
    "OPS-GAO-2025-12",
    "WX-GAO-2025-12",
